.TH "PARKING\-CATEGORY\-MODEL\-TRAIN" "1" "November 2026" "parking\-category\-model 0.1.0" "Parking Category Model Manual"
.SH NAME
parking\-category\-model\-train \- transfer\-learning training of the photo\-to\-106\-category classifier
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python \-m parking_category_model.train \-\-data\-dir DIR \-\-out FILE [\-\-epochs N] [\-\-val\-split F] [\-\-seed N]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Trains the classifier on a private folder laid out with one sub\-folder per class id and saves a Keras model file. Needs the 'train' extra (TensorFlow). The data folder lives outside this repository; the code never copies, logs or uploads images.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-data\-dir DIR
private training\-data folder, one sub\-folder per class id (see labels.json); must live outside the repository \- the code never copies, logs or uploads images (required)
.TP
.B \-\-out FILE
where to write the .keras model file (required)
.TP
.B \-\-epochs N
number of training epochs (default: 10)
.TP
.B \-\-val\-split F
validation fraction of the data (default: 0.2)
.TP
.B \-\-seed N
random seed for the shuffled split (default: 0)
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
python \-m parking_category_model.train \-\-data\-dir /path/to/private\-data \-\-out model.keras
.RS
Train with defaults and save model.keras.
.RE
